8-18T15:50:08Z","closed_at":"2026-08-18T15:11:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122487","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122487","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122487.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122487.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-18T15:11:55Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nMulti-instance runs are disabled in the Android editor due to screen size and UX limitations. However, standalone XR devices have virtually an infinite screen, so they are not suggest to the same constraints. As such this PR adds support for multi-instance runs on standalone XR devices.\r\n\r\nOn Android, each activity process needs to be defined in the `AndroidManifest`, so multi-instance runs in the Android editor are limited to `2` at the moment. \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d0c01fac-e6ba-4642-9f6e-775dabc61920\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAddresses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11937 for standalone XR devices.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo"